, "pos": [-874.9943237304688, 4917.7822265625], "widgets_values": ["subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> = A blonde woman with long wavy hair, blue eyes, wearing a navy blue bucket hat with \"WP\" logo, small hoop earrings, and a light blue off-the-shoulder crop top with puffy sleeves.\n<Picture 2> = The blonde woman standing in a full-length pose wearing distressed denim shorts, light blue and white platform sneakers, and ankle star tattoos.\n\nretention_analysis:\nThe woman is in her light blue off-the-shoulder crop top and distressed denim shorts. Ignore the background."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 679, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 986, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 25}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [357], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [314.0339050292969, 211.54986572265625], "pos": [-881.8604125976562, 5164.49951171875], "widgets_values": ["[STYLE]\nThe output is matches the style of <Picture 1>. Sharp detail on eyes and face. The style never changes and never drifts between shots. No shadows.\n\n\n[STAGING]\nSolid light grey seamless backdrop, one flat uniform tone edge to edge, with no gradient, no vignette, no texture and no floor line. Nothing else is in frame. the subject casts no shadow onto the backdrop and no contact shadow on the ground beneath it, and it does not sit in its own shadow. Soft form shading on the subject itself is fine and should read its shape. Long telephoto lens, near-orthographic.\n\nThe character holds one relaxed A-pose throughout: arms hanging slightly away from the body, palms toward the thighs, feet shoulder-width apart, head level, calm neutral expression, eyes open and looking forward.\nThe subject is completely frozen, as rigid and motionless as a statue. Only the camera moves. There is no wind, no breeze, no air movement, no breathing, no settling, no sway, no secondary motion of any kind. Orientation, surfaces and lighting are identical in every shot, and the subject stays the same size in frame.\n\n[0-2 seconds] tight full shot of the subject. The camera makes one smooth fixed-speed orbit to the left around it, sweeping 180 degrees: starting square on the back, passing the left side a third of the way through this move, and ending square on the front at 2 seconds. The subject does not move at all. Ends on the back view at 2 seconds.\n\n[2-3 seconds] Camera whip-pans front and snaps into a fast push-in on the character's upper body. Locked-off head and shoulders close-up, face square to camera, eyes into the lens. Ends on a sharp front-on face at 3 seconds.\n\n[CAMERA] One constant-speed 180-degree orbit in beat 1, then a hard whip-pan back to front and a push-in for beat 2. No zoom, no dolly, no tilt, no roll, no handheld shake, no motion blur, no dissolves beyond the one whip-pan cut.\n[AUDIO] Silence. No music, no room tone, no voices.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 239, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt for orbiting - (Keep Picture 1's Style)", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [679], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "size": [459.4777526855469, 580.2219848632812], "pos": [-1357.2303466796875, 4915.95703125], "widgets_values": ["Normal - Describe", "分析图片，按照示例结果输出描述", "# Role & Task\n你是一个专业的图像分析专家。即使用户只输入 1 张图片，你也需要基于该图像的主体，分别生成 <Picture 1>（上半身/近景细节）和 <Picture 2>（全身/姿态与完整剪裁）两条描述，并给出 Retention 总结。\n\n# Output Format Requirements\n请严格按照以下格式输出，不得添加任何额外的前言、解释或标点说明：\n\nsubject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> = [基于该图，描述主体的发型、面部、首饰及上半身服装细节]\n<Picture 2> = [基于该图，推断/描述主体的全身姿态、完整礼服剪裁（如裙摆款式）及鞋履]\n\nretention_analysis:\n[总结主体的核心特征/服装，并加上 Ignore the background.]\n\n# Few-Shot Example\n【示例输入】：\n（用户上传 1 张金发女士图片）\n\n【示例输出】：\nsubject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> = A blonde woman with long wavy hair, blue eyes, wearing a silver necklace, red drop earrings, and a elegant off-the-shoulder velvet burgundy evening gown.\n<Picture 2> = The blonde woman standing in a full-length velvet burgundy evening gown with a fishtail hem and high heels.\n\nretention_analysis:\nThe woman is in her burgundy evening gown. Ignore the background.\n\n# Rules & Constraints\n1. 即使只有 1 张输入图片，必须同时输出 `<Picture 1>` 和 `<Picture 2>` 两行：\n   - `<Picture 1>`：专注于外貌、发型、眼睛、首饰、上半身服装款式与材质。\n   - `<Picture 2>`：专注于全身姿态（如 standing）、完整礼服剪裁（如 fishtail hem/full-length）与鞋履（如 high heels）。\n2. `retention_analysis:` 必须简明，末尾固定或体现 \"Ignore the background.\"。\n3. 全文一律使用英文输出。", "one by one", 24, 256, 349245659779734, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 677, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 678, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "loca